    "created_at": "2019-06-24T13:47:35Z",
    "updated_at": "2019-06-24T13:47:35Z",
    "body": "Is this something that would need to be passed through a service worker that does `evt.respondWith(fetch(evt.request))`?\r\n\r\nAlso, how would this interact with the element lifecycle?  For example, if the element is removed and discarded during the fetch, will the fetch keep it alive?",
